	(text "POWER INPUT: VIN 12-24V (fan rail) + 5V, each fused 5A (mini blade 32V), no regulator. LD7 = VIN present, LD8 = 5V present"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.0 2.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f345ae4d-b517-4370-9161-913dd27d1925")
	)
	(text "MCU: Waveshare RP2350-Zero on female headers, USB powered. 5V pin left open (no backfeed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 63.5 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0777b353-7f4e-4d74-a6ca-c2646f71ee77")
	)
	(text "FANS 1-6: JPx selects VIN (1-2) or 5V (2-3). JMx: 1-2 = 4-pin PWM fan (GND solid), 2-3 = 2/3-pin fan (AO3400A switches fan GND from the 5V PWM line, B5819W flyback). BSS138DW = 3V3->5V PWM shifter. Tach: 10k pull-up, 4.7k + BAT54S clamp. LDx lights when the port is powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "23142cb7-5db4-435e-8e29-ea8ddd035710")
	)
	(text "LED OUTPUTS: JLx selects VIN (1-2) or 5V (2-3) for the strip, data is 5V: 74HCT2G17 dual buffer (TTL-level inputs) + 330R series, 10k pull-downs keep LEDs quiet when the MCU is off"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 109.22 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cab34ab8-41b0-4629-a39c-edd7137c60d8")
	)
	(text "EXP: GP14, GP15 + 3V3 + GND"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 210.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2a1cc404-2471-41c5-8db4-fbf6b657f5aa")
	)
	(text "THERMISTOR INPUTS TH1-TH4 (GP26-GP29 ADC): 100k NTC to GND, 4.7k 1% pull-up to 3V3, 100nF filter"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 215.9 0)
		(effects
